xnu 0491: read the qca6490 pbl auth inputs

Measured 2026-11-27: the iOS root image matches the phone's stock `modem.img`
`amss20.bin` byte for byte in the first 512 KiB (`0x163c3337`), so the image
is not the gap and the audit's donor sum was wrong. The QCA6490 PBL log
starts at `0x01403da0` and is 10 words, not the QCA6390 base 0489 read.
`pbl_auth.c` reads `WLAN_SECURE_BOOTN` twice back to back and selects a root
certificate from `0x01e22b2c`/`0x01e22b3c`; read those, the full log, the
WLAON stack canary and memory-SVS register, and the BHI error-debug words.
The TCSR error-debug reads hang this worker and stay out.

